WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.963
JEFF: I'm a big guy,
so I didn't think that a current

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:08.258
could actually push my body
the way that it is.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:11.594
♪ 

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:14.139
The most challenging thing
about being in this current

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.183
is to be at the mercy
of Mother Nature

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.229
and allowing the current to
take you wherever it takes you.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:24.357
Except for into the coral;
that's no good.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.901
♪ 

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.236
But once I took a breath

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.572
and focused on moving my body
with the current,

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.906
rather than fighting it,

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:35.243
I started feeling more confident
in what I was doing.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.746
I'm finally able
to control myself,

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.039
and I'm rewarded

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.417
with an absolutely amazing
underwater experience.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:46.838
♪ 

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:49.340
And that was the tightest
I've ever went

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:52.677
through any coral reef.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:53.720
They were just everywhere.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:01:02.687
♪ 

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:04.189
Just gliding through it

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:07.901
and seeing the walls
on each side of us.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.736
I've never seen anything
like that before.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:13.448
♪ 

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.116
There was so much marine life.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:26.169
♪ 

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:29.464
This coral was one of the dopest
things I've ever seen,

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:33.635
but navigating the current
was kind of hard.

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:35.303
Whoo!

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:37.138
And showed me that being
in rougher waters

00:01:37.138 --> 00:01:39.140
with these fast-moving
whale sharks

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.810
is definitely gonna be
an intense challenge.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.604
♪ 

